{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to Galactix! </strong><br><br><strong>It was the year 2019 when the Xidus fleet came to conquer Earth. </strong><br> <br><strong>Galactix</strong> is a fast-paced vertical scrolling space shooter where players pilot a high-tech fighter to defend Earth from the alien Xidus fleet. Featuring VGA graphics and classic sound effects, the game combines unlimited ammo with strategic energy management, allowing players to unleash missiles, bombs, and use a retractable claw to collect power-ups mid-battle. With waves of enemies and intense boss fights, Galactix delivers nostalgic arcade action wrapped in a sci-fi storyline of planetary survival. Galactix will also include the brand new\u00a0<strong>Enchanced Mode</strong> with graphics and audio improvements for those looking for a new experience. <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937840?t=1768257441","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937840/7a615a92ffa378ced6b374609f117a262ce7b7fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768257441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937840/d3771c1ce41f6a47f7cdfb791d4d8cebe7a9aa4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768257441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937840/d3771c1ce41f6a47f7cdfb791d4d8cebe7a9aa4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768257441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to Galactix! </strong><br><br><strong>It was the year 2019 when the Xidus fleet came to conquer Earth. </strong><br> <br><strong>Galactix</strong> is a fast-paced vertical scrolling space shooter where players pilot a high-tech fighter to defend Earth from the alien Xidus fleet. Featuring VGA graphics and classic sound effects, the game combines unlimited ammo with strategic energy management, allowing players to unleash missiles, bombs, and use a retractable claw to collect power-ups mid-battle. With waves of enemies and intense boss fights, Galactix delivers nostalgic arcade action wrapped in a sci-fi storyline of planetary survival. Galactix will also include the brand new\u00a0<strong>Enchanced Mode</strong> with graphics and audio improvements for those looking for a new experience. <br> </p>","developers":["Scott Host","Strollart"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937840/aacedc25264a01a08b603dc1c1499b90723ce11f/header.jpg?t=1768257441","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Galactix","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 660 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Scott Host"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset